{
  "id": "pitch-black-build-battle-box",
  "name": "Pitch Black Build & Battle Box",
  "category": "product_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "Given to players at the Pitch Black prerelease tournaments on the weekends of 4–5 and 11–12 July 2026. Each box held four Pitch Black booster packs and a 40-card deck built around one of four promos with the Pitch Black logo. The decks also held non-holo copies of Miraidon, Spiritomb, Bastiodon, Silvally and Voltaic Lightning Energy, which booster packs have only in holofoil, and of Perfect Order's Telepathic Psychic Energy and Chaos Rising's Magnetic Metal Energy.",
